// Your board.
//
// It starts as the plain NUCLEO-F401RE. Anything you add from the palette in
// the board view is appended below, and this is the file that is loaded when
// you run the simulation -- so the board you drew and the board your code runs
// on are the same file rather than two descriptions that can drift apart.
//
// You can also edit this by hand. The board view reads what is here when it
// starts, so a part you declare yourself is drawn like any other.
//
// Do not edit boards/nucleo_f401re.repl. That is the board itself, and it is
// updated for everyone.

using "boards/nucleo_f401re.repl"
